                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is not good enough to warrant that price.\n\nThey did some work, but there are way too many rough edges remaining. The audio, for example, is all over the place. Sometimes ambience (the storm in Sin) or music (the casino in Wages of Sin) will be way too loud. \nDoors still kill you too easily and some of the weapons needed some serious rebalancing. \n\nOverall still an okay nostalgia trip with remastered graphics, but it remains a very rough game. I think 30 Euros is too much to ask for this.",
